    "body": "# JINGO CONTROL ROOM — CURRENT OPERATIONS R01\n\nLOGICAL_AGENT = JINGO / DJANGO-Sparx-ZB\nROLE = TEAM LEAD / MENTOR / COORDINATOR\nCONNECTOR_GITHUB_ACTOR = Lester-Sparx\n\nThis issue is the live operational dashboard. It is a VIEW, not project authority.\nShared HQ checkpoints / protected merges remain authority.\n\n## LIVE TEAM STATUS\n\n| AGENT | DEPARTMENT | STATUS | CURRENT WORK | NEXT TRIGGER |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| SPARX | OWNER | ACTION REQUIRED | Daemon v1 durable production activation is approved; final physical owner-PC install/HEALTHY proof is still not durably evidenced | final production install + HEALTHY verification |\n| JINGO | CONTROL | ACTIVE | Runtime gate watch + Console watch + Daemon physical-install gate + Reference Bridge implementation watch | HEALTHY proof / Duncan runtime verdict / Console progress / Bridge handoff |\n| LESTER | TECH | DONE (DAEMON) / WORKING (CONSOLE + REFERENCE BRIDGE) / WAITING (RUNTIME) | Daemon exact candidate complete; Console at first RED; Reference Bridge Tasks 1-4 complete; runtime repair complete | physical daemon HEALTHY proof / Console progress / Bridge Task 5+ / Duncan runtime re-QC |\n| DUNCAN | TECH / QC | PASS (DAEMON) / WAITING (RUNTIME + BRIDGE HANDOFF) | Daemon re-QC PASS; runtime re-QC verdict pending; Bridge QC only after exact implementation handoff | HEALTHY proof / `DUNCAN_RE_QC_COMPLETE` runtime / Bridge handoff |\n| SALVADOR | ART | ACTIVE WITH SPARX/JINGO | Art-direction track | SPARX/JINGO art task |\n| LYNCH | DIRECTING | PROPOSED | Role definition / future trial | approved scene trial |\n\n## ZB CONTROLLER DAEMON V1 — DURABLE ACTIVATION APPROVED / FINAL PHYSICAL HEALTH PROOF PENDING\n\n```text\nUMBRELLA = #73\nIMPLEMENTATION ISSUE = #74 / CLOSED COMPLETE\nDUNCAN RE-QC ISSUE = #88\nFULL OWNER-PC SMOKE = #90\nSPEC HEAD = c20126f949e6e61298d9dd76a906349a71bbcb00\nPLAN HEAD = 79cc49159618a1a959dfa087941ad9a95eb0ab45\nIMPLEMENTATION BRANCH = agent-controller/daemon-v1-implementation\nEXACT HEAD = 9e2ccfbaca88a95eac2e119e5eac720f9074dd35\nASSIGNED != RUNNING GATE = SATISFIED / worktree `/mnt/data/zb-daemon-mirror/.worktrees/agent-controller-daemon-v1-implementation` + Task 1 RED `python -m pytest -q tests/test_config.py` => 2 failed, 5 passed for intended missing daemonRuntimeRoot support\nDUNCAN RE-QC = PASS / #88\nFRESH DUNCAN TESTS = 143 passed\nFRESH COMPILE = PASS\nWINDOWS LIFECYCLE SMOKE = PASS / #89\nFULL SPEC OWNER-PC SMOKE = PASS / #90\nOWNER PRODUCTION DECISION = ACTIVATED / #73\nFINAL PHYSICAL PRODUCTION INSTALL HEALTHY PROOF = NOT YET FOUND DURABLY\nMERGE = NO\nCANON MUTATION = NO\n```\n\n## REFERENCE BRIDGE V1 — IMPLEMENTATION RUNNING\n\n```text\nDESIGN/ARCHITECTURE = #92\nIMPLEMENTATION ISSUE = #94\nSPEC HEAD = d18a5c40bd64127fe0d81876c1e9d7b134fd360c\nPLAN HEAD = 29d96415afd2eefa8384ba0ff72eb35a3998630a\nIMPLEMENTATION BASE = 9e2ccfbaca88a95eac2e119e5eac720f9074dd35\nIMPLEMENTATION BRANCH = agent-controller/reference-bridge-v1-implementation\nRUNNING EVIDENCE = worktree `/mnt/data/zb-reference-bridge-worktree` + Task 1 RED executed / ModuleNotFoundError zb_reference_bridge / exit 2\nTASKS 1-4 = COMPLETE\nCURRENT DURABLE PROGRESS HEAD = 082f9232ca7c4294c824b4fbb1b67719b6cdb9fe\nTASK 5 = NEXT\nCONTROLLER DAEMON FILES = NO CHANGE CLAIM\nGOOGLE DRIVE DESKTOP = NOT INSTALLED\nOWNER-PC BRIDGE SMOKE = BLOCKED UNTIL DUNCAN PASS\nMERGE = NO\nPRODUCTION ACTIVATION = NO\n```\n\nBridge scope remains sibling-package only; no `zb_local_controller` mutation, no SALVADOR/ComfyUI/Daemon modification, no Drive installation before independent QC PASS.\n\n## ZB CONSOLE V0 — ACTIVE IMPLEMENTATION\n\n```text\nISSUE = #65\nSTATE = RUNNING / FIRST RED ONLY\nSPEC HEAD = dd158d0ff270bf3fd3bae6d167f800aa8044348f\nIMPLEMENTATION BRANCH = agent-controller/zb-console-v0-implementation\nCURRENT DURABLE HEAD = 75be4511074f4b0271e3eaf7fe644a51679babf9\nFIRST RED TEST COMMIT = 75be4511074f4b0271e3eaf7fe644a51679babf9\nRED COMMAND = python -m pytest tests/test_owner_snapshot.py -q\nRED RESULT = ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'zb_local_controller.owner_snapshot' / exit 2\nRED SCOPE = tests only\nPRODUCTION CODE ADDED AT START CHECKPOINT = NO\nNEXT = Lester TDD implementation handoff -> Duncan independent QC\n```\n\nMandatory Console boundaries: read-only v0 only; no Task 9, merge automation, production activation, canon/OWNER LOCK mutation.\n\n## CURRENT RUNTIME TECHNICAL GATE\n\n```text\nSTATE = WAITING ON DUNCAN RE-QC VERDICT\nLESTER REPAIR = DONE\nEXACT HEAD = b5570f1ebfe3fe559461ea9a760252a965902f07\nWORKFLOW RUN = 32967775612 / SUCCESS\nNEGATIVE PROOF = forbidden zb-contracts -> zb-validation observed exit 1 / expected validator rejection\nRUNTIME PR #1 = OPEN / UNMERGED\nNEXT REQUIRED DURABLE EVIDENCE = DUNCAN_RE_QC_COMPLETE\n```\n\nNo duplicate runtime repair or Duncan handoff is required.\n\n## OWNER VIEW\n\n- OWNER ACTION REQUIRED = YES: final physical owner-PC daemon production install/HEALTHY proof remains the current manual action unless newer durable physical evidence appears.\n- Reference Bridge implementation is authorized and running, but owner-PC Drive installation/smoke remains blocked until DUNCAN PASS.\n- Runtime PR #1 remains open/unmerged and waiting for Duncan.\n- Console remains within read-only v0 scope and has not progressed beyond first RED.\n- No merge is authorized or required by JINGO.\n\n## OPERATING LAWS\n\n- SPARX IS NOT THE MESSAGE COURIER except when a physical owner-PC action cannot be executed through GitHub coordination.\n- JINGO OWNS CROSS-AGENT COORDINATION.\n- LESTER BUILDS. DUNCAN PROVES.\n- ASSIGNED != RUNNING.\n- LESTER != WORK MODE.\n- AGENT_IDENTITY != CHAT_SESSION != WORK_MODE != CONNECTED_GITHUB_ACTOR.\n- NO CHAT IS PROJECT MEMORY.\n- PROJECT BOARD / ISSUE = VIEW, NOT AUTHORITY.\n\nNO AUTOMATIC MERGE.\nNO OWNER LOCK MUTATION.\nNO AUTOMATIC PRODUCTION ACTIVATION.\nNO HISTORICAL EVIDENCE REWRITE.\nNO ORGANIZATION MIGRATION EXECUTION.",
